---
/**
 * DFA: a mixer fader that Does Fuck All (the studio joke: a dummy control for whoever needs
 * something to tweak). It is wired to nothing on purpose: a native range input, no script, no
 * listener, no animation. On the home panel it sits at the foot of the divider line, which doubles
 * as its slot (bottom-right corner on phones). Styles: "DFA" in src/styles/layout.css.
 */
---

<label class="dfa">
  <input class="dfa__fader" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="70" />
  <span class="dfa__label">DFA</span>
</label>
